OL,3,GNEWSASmaller babies perform poorer as
OL,4,Ateens, study finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FBabies who are smaller than expected at
OL,7,Fbirth tend to have poorer school
OL,8,Fperformances as teenagers, a study has
OL,9,Ffound.
OL,11,FMore than 92,000 children were followed
OL,12,Ffrom infancy to adolescence, all of
OL,13,Fwhom were born at full term, between 37
OL,14,Fand 41 weeks pregnant.
OL,16,FThe researchers at the University of
OL,17,FWarwick found that children who weighed
OL,18,Fless than most babies of the same sex,
OL,19,Fborn at the same stage of pregnancy,
OL,20,Ftended to achieve lower scores in
OL,21,Fsubjects like mathematics and reading.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
