OL,3,GNEWSASmaller babies perform poorer as
OL,4,Ateens, study finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe differences were still apparent in
OL,7,Fadolescence, suggesting that the link
OL,8,Fbetween size at birth and academic
OL,9,Fperformance persists well beyond early
OL,10,Fchildhood into mid-teens.
